    18	### HIGH — Watcher v3 still accepts the malformed state specifically identified in P7
    19	
    20	[exp35_phase_i_watch_v3.sh:24](/tmp/claude-1007/-home-yixunhu-codespace-FLAC/1630c6fe-5d3e-42b4-94ec-1b6d3bcb0e4e/scratchpad/r3a/exp35_phase_i_watch_v3.sh:24)
    21	
    22	`all(.chunks[]; …)` is vacuously true for an empty array, and the predicate checks only that `.state` is a string—not that it is one of H35’s four states. Replaying that jq expression read-only produced:
    23	
